{
  "version": 1,
  "courseId": 1362070,
  "sourceLanguage": "en",
  "targetLanguage": "zh-TW",
  "lectures": [
    {
      "id": "39471930",
      "title": "Combining Animations With Layout Animations",
      "sourceHash": "7de91d45cf069668aa269a8e42239f4317b06e38a28ca0fb65e68d264c62fcbc",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 0.33,
          "end": 3.06,
          "en": "Now let's stick to this list here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 3.06,
          "end": 4.44,
          "en": "for the moment.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 4.44,
          "end": 6.39,
          "en": "Most things here look good",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 6.39,
          "end": 9,
          "en": "but there's one strange behavior.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 9,
          "end": 11.52,
          "en": "If I'm in a list with at least two items,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 11.52,
          "end": 14.52,
          "en": "and I view the details of one of these items,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 14.52,
          "end": 17.31,
          "en": "you see that it wobbles around strangely",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 17.31,
          "end": 19.98,
          "en": "like this image gets distorted briefly",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 19.98,
          "end": 22.233,
          "en": "and it doesn't look great.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 23.07,
          "end": 26.07,
          "en": "Now we get this strange behavior here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 26.07,
          "end": 28.05,
          "en": "because our challenge items,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 28.05,
          "end": 31.713,
          "en": "which are our list items have this layout prop on them.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 32.67,
          "end": 35.28,
          "en": "If I would remove that, you would see that",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 35.28,
          "end": 38.29,
          "en": "now it does not behave in this strange way",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 39.27,
          "end": 41.64,
          "en": "but now it just instantly jumps instead.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 41.64,
          "end": 45,
          "en": "And we now of course also lost this sliding animation",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 45,
          "end": 46.443,
          "en": "of the remaining item.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 48.3,
          "end": 50.67,
          "en": "Now we got this strange behavior",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 50.67,
          "end": 52.59,
          "en": "where everything wobbles around",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 52.59,
          "end": 57.15,
          "en": "with layout added here because layout, as mentioned,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 57.15,
          "end": 61.56,
          "en": "gets Framer Motion to animate layout changes",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 61.56,
          "end": 63.72,
          "en": "of this list item.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 63.72,
          "end": 66.39,
          "en": "For example, a change in its position,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 66.39,
          "end": 69.723,
          "en": "like this change in the list in which this item is placed.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 70.56,
          "end": 73.5,
          "en": "But another layout change that gets animated",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 73.5,
          "end": 77.46000000000001,
          "en": "by Framer Motion with that prop added on a component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 77.46000000000001,
          "end": 80.07,
          "en": "is a change in height of that component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 80.07,
          "end": 84.39,
          "en": "And that's exactly what happens if we expand those details.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 84.39,
          "end": 85.223,
          "en": "And that's why",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 85.223,
          "end": 88.743,
          "en": "we're getting this strange wobbly behavior here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 90.33,
          "end": 93.47999999999999,
          "en": "A solution to this problem here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 93.47999999999999,
          "end": 97.983,
          "en": "is to animate this occurrence of this text here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 99.03,
          "end": 102.03,
          "en": "Because if we explicitly animate the appearance",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 102.03,
          "end": 106.2,
          "en": "of this item, this change in height doesn't occur suddenly",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 106.2,
          "end": 108.84,
          "en": "and doesn't trigger this layout animation.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 108.84,
          "end": 109.953,
          "en": "That's the idea.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 111.42,
          "end": 114.63,
          "en": "So to animate the appearance of this item here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 114.63,
          "end": 118.47999999999999,
          "en": "we should change this div here to a motion.div",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 120,
          "end": 123.12,
          "en": "and then add an initial animation state",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 123.12,
          "end": 125.58,
          "en": "so that we can set up an entry animation",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 125.58,
          "end": 128.913,
          "en": "if this gets expanded with initial and animate.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 131.1,
          "end": 134.37,
          "en": "And the initial state should, for example, be",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 134.37,
          "end": 137.82,
          "en": "that the height of this item is zero,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 137.82,
          "end": 140.373,
          "en": "because it's not there yet,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 141.54,
          "end": 144.993,
          "en": "and the opacity is zero maybe so that it's transparent.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 145.98,
          "end": 149.22,
          "en": "But we then animate to a height auto,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 149.22,
          "end": 151.86,
          "en": "which is a value you can animate to.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 151.86,
          "end": 154.77,
          "en": "So you're not limited to hard-coded values,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 154.77,
          "end": 156.72,
          "en": "but instead you can also use auto",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 156.72,
          "end": 158.89,
          "en": "if you don't know the height in advance",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 160.35,
          "end": 161.97,
          "en": "and an opacity of one,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 161.97,
          "end": 164.493,
          "en": "so that this is not transparent anymore.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 166.8,
          "end": 168.69299999999998,
          "en": "With that, if I save this,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 170.07,
          "end": 174.32999999999998,
          "en": "if I expand this, this now expands smoothly.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 174.32999999999998,
          "end": 179.28300000000002,
          "en": "Closing it still is strange, but expanding works just fine.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 180.24,
          "end": 183.03,
          "en": "And closing of course looks strange,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 183.03,
          "end": 184.59,
          "en": "because, as you learned,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 184.59,
          "end": 187.77,
          "en": "this item gets removed from the DOM instantly here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 187.77,
          "end": 189.663,
          "en": "if isExpanded is false.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 190.59,
          "end": 192.84,
          "en": "There is no exit animation being played.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 192.84,
          "end": 195.27,
          "en": "And it also wouldn't be played if we added like this",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 195.27,
          "end": 197.433,
          "en": "because it gets removed instantly.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 198.72,
          "end": 201.48,
          "en": "So we have to do what we already did before.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 201.48,
          "end": 205.323,
          "en": "We have to wrap this with AnimatePresence,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 206.49,
          "end": 208.023,
          "en": "this entire block here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 209.49,
          "end": 210.45,
          "en": "And for this of course,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 210.45,
          "end": 213.84,
          "en": "AnimatePresence must be imported into this file.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 213.84,
          "end": 216.3,
          "en": "And then we can add an exit animation",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 216.3,
          "end": 219.633,
          "en": "where we, for example, animate back to this initial state.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 222.18,
          "end": 224.76,
          "en": "And with that now, if we save this,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 224.76,
          "end": 229.76,
          "en": "both expanding and closing plays with a smooth animation",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 229.77,
          "end": 233.14,
          "en": "and does not distort other parts of those items",
          "zh": ""
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "errors": []
}